{"id":51775,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51775"},"modified":"2026-09-06T18:45:44","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T17:45:44","slug":"confluencia-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/confluencia-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>21 e 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> na emblem\u00e1tica vila de <strong>Const\u00e2ncia<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>), ponto de encontro m\u00e1gico entre os rios Tejo e Z\u00eazere. Promovido pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Const\u00e2ncia<\/strong> e integrado no circuito <strong>3 Rios Trail Trophy<\/strong>, o evento combina a promo\u00e7\u00e3o do patrim\u00f3nio ribeirinho com desafios t\u00e9cnicos de excel\u00eancia.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa arranca no s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde com o <strong>Conflu\u00eancia Kids<\/strong> (15:00) e o contrarrel\u00f3gio explosivo da <strong>Epik Mile (1,6 km)<\/strong> pelas ruelas hist\u00f3ricas (16:30). No domingo de manh\u00e3 decorrem as grandes dist\u00e2ncias: o <strong>Trail Longo K34 (34 km e +1500m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto K25 (25 km e +1000m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail K15 (15 km e +570m D+)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada K10 (10 km e +400m D+)<\/strong>, com abastecimentos completos e medalha de Finisher para todos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 e 22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; f