u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado decorrem o Conflu\u00eancia Kids (15:00) e a Epik Mile (16:30). No domingo partem o Trail Longo K34 (08:30), o Trail Curto K25 (08:50), o Mini Trail K15 (09:15) e a Caminhada K10 (09:30).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova integra algum circuito ou trof\u00e9u oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o Conflu\u00eancia Trail est\u00e1 integrado no prestigiado circuito regional 3 Rios Trail Trophy.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos e lembran\u00e7a de Finisher oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">At\u00e9 quando e onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop&#038;Go at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 (ou no limite de 800 atletas), com informa\u00e7\u00f5es atualizadas no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia (Av. For\u00e7as Armadas)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Const\u00e2ncia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Const\u00e2ncia\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026 em Const\u00e2ncia (Santar\u00e9m), com secretariado e centro nevr\u00e1lgico no Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o e na praia fluvial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado decorrem o Conflu\u00eancia Kids (15:00) e a Epik Mile (16:30). No domingo partem o Trail Longo K34 (08:30), o Trail Curto K25 (08:50), o Mini Trail K15 (09:15) e a Caminhada K10 (09:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova integra algum circuito ou trof\u00e9u oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o Conflu\u00eancia Trail est\u00e1 integrado no prestigiado circuito regional 3 Rios Trail Trophy.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos e lembran\u00e7a de Finisher oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"At\u00e9 quando e onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop&Go at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 (ou no limite de 800 atletas), com informa\u00e7\u00f5es atualizadas no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67260,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1129],"class_list":["post-51775","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-constancia-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_5-3-rios-trail-trophy"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/confluencia-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51775","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/type